WEBVTT

00:12.870 --> 00:18.290
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

01:29.990 --> 01:34.990
TRUE HEART

01:47.770 --> 01:50.630
You really don't flinch, do you?

01:50.630 --> 01:53.010
So you thought of everything, me?

01:53.010 --> 01:54.960
Well, of course.

01:54.960 --> 01:58.740
I already figured out most of the concept
of this Great Labyrinth.

01:59.120 --> 02:02.330
On top of that, I also take into account
Amanogawa's testimony,

02:02.330 --> 02:05.200
so I kinda had a feeling this would happen.

02:05.730 --> 02:08.270
By the way,
what do you mean by concept?

02:09.060 --> 02:11.190
You're me, aren't you?

02:11.190 --> 02:13.530
Then, I shouldn't tell you
to know yourself.

02:13.530 --> 02:18.210
Hang on. I am you,
but I don't know everything you do.

02:18.210 --> 02:20.190
You also thought of that, didn't you?

02:21.010 --> 02:25.310
The concept of this Great Labyrinth
is to "conquer yourself".

02:25.310 --> 02:29.130
Your negative aspects,
your dark heart that you tried to overlook,

02:29.130 --> 02:31.870
and your running away
from the unacceptable reality...

02:31.870 --> 02:33.550
Your conflicting feelings...

02:34.130 --> 02:36.800
Whether you can overcome all of that...

02:37.370 --> 02:41.560
Even if you have great power,
without a strong mind, it's pointless.

02:41.950 --> 02:46.060
Perhaps this is a trial so that
God doesn't take advantage of us.

02:47.420 --> 02:51.570
That's me for you!
You hit the jackpot right away.

02:51.960 --> 02:52.790
Tch.

03:25.140 --> 03:27.420
All right, Hajime Nagumo.

03:27.420 --> 03:30.520
Can you win against yourself?

03:33.260 --> 03:34.150
Drop dead!

03:53.050 --> 03:56.150
My, you've really got the power, eh?

03:56.150 --> 03:59.140
That's definitely not something
a normal person has.

04:05.070 --> 04:09.210
The monstrous strength...
The bloodstained hands...

04:09.210 --> 04:11.650
The heart that doesn't waver for murder.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.650
What's your point?

04:13.650 --> 04:15.900
Do you really think you still have a place...

04:16.180 --> 04:17.900
...in your homeland?

04:18.560 --> 04:21.160
That world doesn't take kindly to murderers.

04:21.710 --> 04:24.440
Who would want to accept a monster?

04:35.550 --> 04:37.660
You're actually scared, aren't you?

04:37.660 --> 04:41.720
That you'd already lost your home
since long, long ago?

04:43.600 --> 04:47.970
You're scared that your family
back home might reject you...

04:47.970 --> 04:49.270
...when you're back, huh?

04:49.700 --> 04:51.520
Quite the cliched line there.

04:52.010 --> 04:56.180
That's why you can't ignore
what Aiko Hatayama said.

04:56.180 --> 05:00.780
She dictated how you would live after returning,
which rippled through your mind.

05:03.010 --> 05:07.670
You look up to her as your mentor
because she brought one of the answers,

05:07.670 --> 05:11.290
albeit a minor one, to a concern that had
been smouldering in the back of your mind.

05:14.290 --> 05:16.970
But even if you won't live a sad life,

05:16.970 --> 05:20.730
it doesn't change the fact that
you're a monster with blood on you.

05:20.730 --> 05:24.800
Your family over there won't accept you.

05:25.270 --> 05:29.730
You said you didn't feel anything
when you first killed someone.

05:30.490 --> 05:34.060
But I know that it's a lie.

05:35.350 --> 05:37.190
Even if you have no regrets,

05:37.590 --> 05:39.760
you surely felt the one emotion...

05:39.760 --> 05:41.070
That is fear.

05:43.710 --> 05:47.840
Good thing Yue's with you, huh?
With Yue around.

05:47.840 --> 05:52.710
If you say that, you can cling to her
even when everything else rejects you.

05:54.800 --> 05:59.460
Do you love Yue? From your heart?
No smokes and mirrors?

05:59.460 --> 06:01.470
No, you don't.

06:04.110 --> 06:06.100
It's just dependence.

06:08.780 --> 06:10.730
When you were rejected,

06:10.730 --> 06:13.350
you sought for a being
who could protect your heart...

06:13.350 --> 06:17.090
Most of the emotion you delude yourself
into thinking is affection...

06:17.090 --> 06:19.580
...turns out to be merely a sense of peace.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.480
That's right.

06:20.870 --> 06:24.240
Yue is just insurance to you.

06:41.210 --> 06:45.090
I guess it is what it is
by nature of the trial,

06:45.090 --> 06:46.860
but man, you yap too much.

06:48.010 --> 06:51.030
My words are what your heart is...

06:51.030 --> 06:54.640
You know I wasn't
merely talking random stuff.

06:56.180 --> 06:58.330
How can you be so composed?

06:58.330 --> 07:03.110
Humans can't look straight at
their filthiest corner of mind.

07:03.900 --> 07:07.040
If that's your definition of a human,

07:07.040 --> 07:09.910
then I sure am no longer one.

07:09.910 --> 07:14.120
Maybe I'm just a monster,
born and raised in the abyss.

07:14.710 --> 07:15.720
But...

07:17.380 --> 07:19.740
I may... get rejected there.

07:20.310 --> 07:22.860
Maybe I won't have a place back home.

07:23.550 --> 07:25.240
Even so...

07:25.820 --> 07:27.220
I still push forward.

07:28.630 --> 07:31.010
You'll still deceive yourself
and push forward?

07:31.330 --> 07:35.820
You think I walked the easy path
by deceiving myself?

07:37.690 --> 07:39.540
It was also the same in the abyss.

07:40.240 --> 07:43.500
No matter the worries,
no matter the fear...

07:43.500 --> 07:46.590
You'd always pierce through it all
with your will as a weapon.

07:47.860 --> 07:51.810
Besides, a Great Labyrinth that
produced a monster like me...

07:51.810 --> 07:55.540
It's really a joke to try to
understand me with words now.

07:55.880 --> 08:00.040
Do you think a monster like you
can live a proper life from here?

08:00.470 --> 08:04.550
There's a lot of weirdos
who actually like such monster.

08:04.550 --> 08:05.360
Yeah.

08:05.990 --> 08:09.050
Right, let me correct that for you.

08:09.790 --> 08:12.810
Not most, but only one percent at most.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.310
What?

08:14.900 --> 08:18.230
I only look at Yue
as insurance for one percent.

08:18.230 --> 08:21.710
The rest is affection.

08:25.310 --> 08:27.320
At least make it ten percent.

08:36.870 --> 08:39.870
You're surpassing me...

08:39.870 --> 08:44.210
No way... I sense no sign
of me getting weakened too...

08:44.640 --> 08:45.710
Weakened?

08:46.390 --> 08:49.140
This is a trial to overcome yourself.

08:49.140 --> 08:52.500
Every time you get over
your own negative emotions,

08:52.500 --> 08:55.280
I, the virtual representation
of them all, will get weakened.

08:55.770 --> 08:59.230
Conversely, the more you look away,
I get stronger.

09:00.650 --> 09:02.730
So that's how it works?

09:10.970 --> 09:14.200
But you haven't won over me.

09:14.200 --> 09:17.520
You're just pushing the problem ahead,
postponing it.

09:19.270 --> 09:22.770
As proof of that,
I haven't been weakened yet.

09:22.770 --> 09:25.540
At the very least,
our power should be equal.

09:25.540 --> 09:28.620
Yet, how are you surpassing me?!

09:28.620 --> 09:30.720
I am you, and you are me!

09:30.720 --> 09:34.840
To be precise, you are the me
before I met you, right?

09:34.840 --> 09:35.850
Right?

09:35.850 --> 09:38.350
Wh-What do you mean?

09:44.440 --> 09:46.050
You don't get it?

09:46.050 --> 09:50.260
An image like you is made
using information obtained from me.

09:50.260 --> 09:55.370
Maybe you obtained it from when I entered
this Labyrinth, and until I reached this ice tree.

09:57.020 --> 10:01.710
That means you are the version
of me only a few minutes ago.

10:01.710 --> 10:06.410
So I just have to be stronger
than I was a few minutes ago.

10:06.410 --> 10:08.130
That's all there is to it.

10:08.490 --> 10:09.730
No way...

10:10.250 --> 10:11.630
Such thing...

10:12.210 --> 10:13.740
You have my gratitude.

10:14.160 --> 10:17.630
Thanks to you,
I could understand closely how I move.

10:17.630 --> 10:22.390
I do have habits or useless movements
without me noticing, huh...

10:22.970 --> 10:25.670
You corrected your movements mid-battle?!

10:26.610 --> 10:27.860
Unbelievable...

10:28.580 --> 10:31.300
I can't believe someone
would turn upon this trial,

10:31.300 --> 10:34.160
and only step in with his own ability...

10:35.080 --> 10:39.170
Had you wavered,
I would have had a shot.

10:40.160 --> 10:44.140
Don't be stupid.
You had no shot since the start.

10:44.140 --> 10:46.300
An image is just an image in the end.

10:46.650 --> 10:50.420
I'll smash that annoying face of yours.

10:51.080 --> 10:53.420
Isn't that just self-harm?

11:33.500 --> 11:35.390
No matter the path...

11:36.370 --> 11:38.060
I'll go down through it.

11:48.420 --> 11:49.230
Kaori?

11:53.950 --> 11:55.130
Nagumo...

12:00.130 --> 12:01.220
I...

12:01.830 --> 12:03.300
I am okay.

12:15.240 --> 12:17.440
Who's there?

12:20.420 --> 12:23.260
Welcome, me.

12:24.680 --> 12:27.960
Why... How are you here?

12:27.960 --> 12:29.340
You're just a...

12:29.980 --> 12:30.910
A dream...

12:33.440 --> 12:34.410
Or is it?

12:42.570 --> 12:45.640
Get a grip, me.

12:45.640 --> 12:48.040
Or else this will be over quick.

12:51.030 --> 12:54.440
I see... You're a trial.

12:54.440 --> 12:57.050
A trial that I must overcome!

12:57.660 --> 12:58.790
Way too late for that.

13:03.030 --> 13:04.050
Shock Slugger!

13:08.760 --> 13:11.240
That's all for the introduction.

13:11.240 --> 13:13.310
The trance is over.

13:16.960 --> 13:20.420
This is reality, my reality.

13:20.420 --> 13:22.300
Try to defy me.

13:22.300 --> 13:26.330
Slash me with your sharpened blade.

13:26.780 --> 13:28.190
Or...

13:28.820 --> 13:30.080
You can perish here.

13:45.490 --> 13:46.660
Flash Blitz!

13:47.600 --> 13:48.600
Flash Blitz!

13:49.430 --> 13:52.350
Trying to look away again?

13:53.420 --> 13:54.560
What are you...

13:57.940 --> 13:59.400
How sad!

14:03.510 --> 14:06.280
Oh, your sword is getting rough.

14:11.250 --> 14:12.250
Shock Slugger!

14:22.770 --> 14:25.940
Good thing he gave you a gift.

14:25.940 --> 14:29.430
Without that, you would've
died seven times already.

14:30.410 --> 14:35.440
Say, does it hurt?
Do you feel pain? Scared?

14:35.920 --> 14:37.440
You don't have to hide it.

14:38.060 --> 14:41.840
For I am you,
I can tell everything about you.

14:41.840 --> 14:44.200
Yes, I know all about you.

14:46.180 --> 14:48.930
You actually didn't want
to practice swordsmanship.

14:49.570 --> 14:54.500
You actually wanted to wear frilly cute clothes
instead of training wear or Japanese clothes.

14:55.350 --> 14:57.460
You didn't need your fencing stick.

14:57.900 --> 15:00.800
You wanted cute dolls and accessories.

15:02.940 --> 15:04.220
Silence...

15:05.200 --> 15:08.320
When Koki started practising dojo,

15:08.320 --> 15:11.010
it felt like a prince had come to you.

15:11.530 --> 15:15.710
He would surely treat you as a girl,
and protect you.

15:15.710 --> 15:17.280
He would surely spoil you.

15:18.230 --> 15:20.010
That's what you believed,

15:20.620 --> 15:21.740
but you see...

15:21.740 --> 15:22.990
Silence.

15:23.320 --> 15:27.830
What Koki brought to me
was only jealousy toward me.

15:28.230 --> 15:33.270
The girls couldn't stand me
being around him.

15:33.760 --> 15:37.500
Yeah, I still remember all of it.

15:38.250 --> 15:42.180
The words said to the girl who loved Koki.

15:44.710 --> 15:47.010
"You were a girl all along?"

15:49.740 --> 15:51.760
That must've come as a shock.

15:52.070 --> 15:53.270
Shut up!

16:07.220 --> 16:09.630
You don't have to stand up.

16:10.090 --> 16:13.560
If you give up here,
I'll spare your life.

16:14.200 --> 16:18.210
Even if you don't work hard,
someone else will pull the weight.

16:19.460 --> 16:21.920
Now, go to sleep.

16:22.600 --> 16:24.710
What are you...

16:25.160 --> 16:26.960
I'm just giving you a choice.

16:27.360 --> 16:29.120
Give up and go to sleep,

16:29.610 --> 16:32.470
or not give up and suffer to death?

16:40.720 --> 16:41.730
That's right...

16:42.110 --> 16:43.350
I knew it...

16:43.720 --> 16:45.820
I knew you'd stand up.

16:47.500 --> 16:49.150
Blow away, Severance!

16:53.800 --> 16:55.640
Shut your trap!

16:56.070 --> 16:58.250
Your psychological attacks won't work!

16:58.580 --> 17:03.190
Psychological, huh...
But you're just rejecting your emotions.

17:03.190 --> 17:07.090
That's how you toughen up
and silence everyone with your ability,

17:07.090 --> 17:08.760
and always be so considerate...

17:10.670 --> 17:15.760
But you can't admit that you
actually want to rely on someone...

17:15.760 --> 17:18.350
I told you to shut your trap!
Are you deaf?!

17:23.170 --> 17:25.840
It was also the case
when you came to this world.

17:26.800 --> 17:29.110
You were actually feeling so uneasy.

17:30.910 --> 17:33.580
When Nagumo fell into the abyss...

17:33.580 --> 17:36.920
When you could feel death so clearly,

17:36.920 --> 17:41.290
you have always been crippled with
fear of death and murder.

18:03.110 --> 18:04.660
Say...

18:05.080 --> 18:07.510
You were so happy back then, right?

18:07.510 --> 18:08.370
Huh?

18:08.910 --> 18:13.160
When Nagumo saved you
back in the Great Orcus Labyrinth.

18:13.700 --> 18:15.530
You know it, right?

18:15.530 --> 18:20.270
No way you'd forget the most
dramatic event of your life.

18:20.900 --> 18:22.410
What are you on about?

18:22.410 --> 18:25.990
Back then, you clearly had given up.

18:25.990 --> 18:28.620
You were ready
to accept your unfair death.

18:28.620 --> 18:32.710
Which is why his bright
red eyes and broad shadow,

18:32.710 --> 18:36.680
and immense power stole your heart.

18:37.000 --> 18:38.070
No...

18:38.070 --> 18:40.180
It was also the same
when Kaori got killed.

18:40.980 --> 18:46.190
You relied on him, and he told
you to believe and wait for him.

18:47.250 --> 18:49.910
And he really answered.

18:50.750 --> 18:52.830
Just like you believed,

18:52.830 --> 18:56.850
he saved your heart,
alongside your best and childhood friends.

18:57.460 --> 19:00.200
You had been dying to look away...

19:00.840 --> 19:01.770
But now...

19:02.780 --> 19:04.310
You can't fool anyone.

19:05.800 --> 19:08.380
No, it's not! I...

19:08.380 --> 19:09.960
I...

19:17.300 --> 19:19.540
I love Nagumo.

19:22.700 --> 19:27.290
Wow, you actually have a crush
on your best friend's love, huh!

19:31.530 --> 19:33.210
You traitor.

19:43.090 --> 19:45.870
You also attacked Shea earlier, right?

19:46.380 --> 19:47.910
Why's that?

19:48.330 --> 19:52.030
Why not Yue or Kaori, but Shea?

19:53.520 --> 19:55.880
I-I...

19:56.930 --> 19:58.850
The answer is simple.

19:58.850 --> 20:01.120
You know you can't win against Yue.

20:01.120 --> 20:04.020
You don't want to be jealous of Kaori either.

20:05.270 --> 20:08.730
That's why you attacked Shea,
who Nagumo just recently accepted,

20:08.730 --> 20:12.400
and is easy to be jealous of.

20:14.610 --> 20:17.150
What a sore cheater.

20:30.900 --> 20:35.760
So ends your silly little life
with rotten luck.

20:36.490 --> 20:40.590
The reason is that you killed yourself too much.

20:40.590 --> 20:42.740
What a stupid person, me.

20:44.910 --> 20:48.520
Any last words before you die?

20:58.430 --> 20:59.530
I...

21:01.020 --> 21:03.670
I... don't want to die...

21:09.220 --> 21:10.540
Save me...

21:12.420 --> 21:13.670
Someone...

21:14.260 --> 21:16.150
Save me...

21:18.580 --> 21:21.150
Too bad. It's all too late now.

21:21.550 --> 21:23.800
For you to use that phrase.

21:34.270 --> 21:35.840
Unbelievable...

21:40.170 --> 21:40.970
Huh?

21:40.970 --> 21:42.070
Good grief...

21:42.640 --> 21:44.720
Talk about good timing.

21:44.720 --> 21:47.080
This isn't what the Great Labyrinth aims.

21:53.570 --> 21:56.300
Tch, look at you, so beat up.

21:57.790 --> 22:00.590
N-Nagumo...

23:32.930 --> 23:34.820
THANK GOD SHE'S STILL A PERVERT!

23:34.820 --> 23:39.150
THANK GOD SHE'S STILL A PERVERT!
Next episode: Thank God She's Still a Pervert!

23:39.150 --> 23:39.920
THANK GOD SHE'S STILL A PERVERT!
